{"id":"vod_sn_36839","vodId":"36839","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"初音岛III","name_cn":"初音岛III","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/12f4f8f1b2068f1544261b5e2c1b77d6.jpg"},"summary":"一晃眼二十年过去，某日，初音岛风见学园的官方新闻部的权威遭到了非官方部的大胆挑战，毕业季在即，毕业季特刊的出版成为了部里的头等大事，这一次，部长森园立夏（新田惠海 配音）决心去调查那颗传说中永不凋零的樱花树，以“魔法”作为杂志的主题。　　作为新闻部里唯一的男性，芳乃清隆（小野友树 配音）自然肩负重任，温柔美丽善解人意的芳乃夏露露（宫崎羽衣 配音）、清隆青梅竹马的玩伴葛木姬乃（佐佐木未来 配音）、个性较真而又傲娇的瑠川纱罗（樱咲千依 配音）、身体孱弱个性内向的阳之下葵（海保绘果 配音），在这些新闻部同僚的帮助下，清隆会交出一份怎样的答卷呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:46:33","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3XsADEHdXz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SmUAi4Dwm21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3cDzYqFzx61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7Qd6JpeVbm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UFwwhUEkLe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QCB5YdBivh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dkRAKqwW911/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LQAb9aN6kd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7UPmyLSUCp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ctkkvgQcQY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8sN0mSXsHJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iBU6MDc85L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k8bEmBbh1k1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:18.256Z"}